  #paper-par("ˆ where the feature Ci(α) at pixel position i in the rendered feature map is computed by aggregating the Gaussian features along the ray rα(t). The ray traverses from the camera center through the pixel i on the image plane with α denoting the camera view. Here, t ranges from the near plane tn to the far plane tf. The remainder of the image that is not covered by the rendered object")
